meta {
  name: HospitalApi - Auth - Forgot Password
}

env {
  baseUrl = "http://localhost:3000"
}

### Forgot Password
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test.patient@example.com"
}

# Notes:
# - The endpoint will send a reset token to the configured email in production.
# - For local testing, capture `resetToken` from logs or test email transport.
